<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia September inflation falls to 9.4 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Slovenia September inflation falls to 9.4 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistical Office of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>    SLOVENIAN INFLATION		   Sept   Aug  Sept 95</p>
<p>    Monthly consumer price rise (pct)  0.5   0.1	1.3</p>
<p>    Yr/yr rise (pct)			 9.4  10.3     10.8</p>
<p>-- Marja Novak, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
